<graph edgedefault="undirected"><node id="&quot;XIE XIREN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Xie Xiren is the author and editor of the textbook 'Computer Networks' (8th Edition), responsible for its content, revisions, and pedagogical approach."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-619a3067ae9f40e1e3cf52a870151425</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PUBLISHING HOUSE OF ELECTRONICS INDUSTRY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Publishing House of Electronics Industry (also known as 电子工业出版社) is the publisher of the 'Computer Networks' textbook, based in Beijing, responsible for its printing, distribution, and online educational resources."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-619a3067ae9f40e1e3cf52a870151425</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BEIJING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Beijing is a city in China that hosts 6 of the country's 32 Internet Exchange Points (IXPs) as of August 2020."&lt;SEP&gt;"Beijing is the city where the Publishing House of Electronics Industry is located and where the book was published; it serves as the geographic center for the publication and distribution of the textbook."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c4a2f7654873f1e1c6f37434762f36ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-619a3067ae9f40e1e3cf52a870151425</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPUTER NETWORKS (8TH EDITION)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The publication of 'Computer Networks' (8th Edition) in June 2021 is a significant event in academic publishing, representing the latest revision of a long-standing educational textbook that has been part of China’s national higher education planning since the mid-2000s."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-619a3067ae9f40e1e3cf52a870151425</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NATIONAL PLANNED TEXTBOOK FOR THE 11TH FIVE-YEAR PLAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"In 2006, the textbook 'Computer Networks' was officially included in China's National Planned Textbook program for the 11th Five-Year Plan period, signifying its recognition by the Ministry of Education as a key higher education resource."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-619a3067ae9f40e1e3cf52a870151425</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NATIONAL PLANNED TEXTBOOK FOR THE 12TH FIVE-YEAR PLAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The 6th edition (2013) of 'Computer Networks' was designated as a National Planned Textbook for undergraduate education during China's 12th Five-Year Plan, reaffirming its academic importance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-619a3067ae9f40e1e3cf52a870151425</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MINISTRY OF EDUCATION EXCELLENT TEXTBOOK AWARD 2009&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"In 2009, the Ministry of Education awarded the 5th edition (published in 2008) of 'Computer Networks' the title of 'Excellent Textbook,' recognizing its quality and contribution to higher education."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-619a3067ae9f40e1e3cf52a870151425</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HAO ZHIHENG&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Hao Zhiheng is an editor at the Publishing House of Electronics Industry responsible for overseeing the publication of the 8th edition of 'Computer Networks.'"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-619a3067ae9f40e1e3cf52a870151425</data>
</node>
