  <data key="d1">"Huaxin Educational Resources Website (www.hxedu.com.cn) is an online platform operated by the Publishing House of Electronics Industry that hosts courseware and supplementary materials for the textbook 'Computer Networks.'"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-619a3067ae9f40e1e3cf52a870151425</data>
