<node id="&quot;清华大学&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Tsinghua University is implicitly referenced through the author Xie Xiren’s email address (xiexiren@tsinghua.org.cn), indicating his affiliation with or connection to this prestigious institution."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-243d8875e135092451e82e6ee7250806</data>
