<node id="&quot;传播时延&quot;">
  <data key="d2">chunk-0174bb3213f0a9872650fbd9b001dae3</data>
  <data key="d1">"Although '传播时延' itself isn't an extracted entity, the text explicitly ties fiber optics to propagation delay (e.g., 1000 km of fiber yields ~5 ms delay), so this relationship captures that causal link via the '总时延计算' event context."</data>
  <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;发送时延&quot;">
  <data key="d2">chunk-0174bb3213f0a9872650fbd9b001dae3</data>
  <data key="d1">"The tollbooth analogy models sending delay as the time to process all cars through the booth (60 seconds for 10 cars), directly mapping to transmission delay in networking."</data>
  <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;处理时延&quot;">
  <data key="d2">chunk-0174bb3213f0a9872650fbd9b001dae3</data>
  <data key="d1">"Processing delay is one of the four additive components in the total delay equation, reflecting time spent by hosts or routers analyzing packet headers and making forwarding decisions."</data>
  <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
</node>
